N copies at (i·dx, i·dy) with decreasing alpha; 1–3 px per layer (>4 px reads as glitch); static stack fades in at scale 0.94–0.98 → 1 over 0.5–0.8 s; heartbeat depth 1 + sin(p) × 0.2–0.6, one beat per 0.7–1.5 s (HyperFrames rule). Looks: cream #f1efe3 condensed 800 with 6–10 text-shadows +2,+2 in #e8501f, 1.15 → 1 with a 120 ms impact (pm-tankazunori0914-0fc886); cream fill + 3 px black stroke + 4–6 shadows 3 px apart in yellow/orange/red/blue, jitter 1–2 px per frame (pm-gizakdag-b8c59e); 10–20 layers 1–2 px in dark ink with a contrasting outline every few layers, front face solid blue, depth 20–30 px (pm-teslachartz-c58b32); teal/rust shadows at 4 & 8 px (pm-ik-builds-b8bdcf); yellow extruded red-outlined chunky title with badges (pm-davidshulmanfl-371638); rounded display + darker offset duplicate (pm-ror-fly-9950f1); extruded bevel + flare sweep + ring opener (pm-ryzoft-4f85bd, see 3D). | code (js): const depth = (n = 8, dx = 2, dy = 2, c = "#e8501f") =>
  Array.from({ length: n }, (_, i) => `${(i + 1) * dx}px ${(i + 1) * dy}px 0 ${c}`).join(", ");
hero.style.textShadow = depth();        // cream #f1efe3 condensed 800 face on top

Echo trail: 6–10 copies of each letter at previous positions (1 frame apart), lightness 100 % → 30 % (pm-chatgptastra-0d95c7); 8–10 copies offset by velocity × Δt with Δt = 1 frame (pm-himanshutwtxs-5f4b43); 3–5 copies offset 20–40 px, decreasing opacity, lag 2–3 frames (pm-raphaelaubryy-4b137e). Outline echo stack: a solid word with 2–6 stroke-only copies above/below (1 px, 15 %) sliding apart (pm-shneural-2abdfa, pm-codestackr-c071bf, pm-topi-003-9ca6b5, pm-web3wesley-7bb108); stroked duplicates at scale 1.05, stagger 40 ms (pm-safarkhanshuvo-ffd52d); outline copies scrolling vertically one line per beat, 2 px (pm-ghinaiya-nirmal-5d8fec). Sample the timeline back in time — never accumulate frame history — so renders stay deterministic. | code (js): for (let k = 8; k >= 0; k--) {               // oldest first, current on top
  const p = pos(t - k / FPS);                // same timeline, sampled back in time
  ctx.fillStyle = `hsl(0 0% ${100 - k * 8.75}%)`;   // 100 % → 30 %
  ctx.fillText(word, p.x, p.y);
}

Sample ~300–1500 points inside the glyphs (draw the text to an offscreen canvas, keep pixels with alpha > 128 on a grid); fly particles from seeded random positions to targets with ease-out, 800 ms, per-particle delay 0–300 ms, multicoloured 2–3 px dots (pm-vanshwtfff-db0466). Reverse for a dissolve. Engine and forces: PART family. | code (js): off.font = "900 300px Grotesk"; off.fillText("MOTION", 40, 300);
const d = off.getImageData(0, 0, W, H).data, pts = [];
for (let y = 0; y < H; y += 6) for (let x = 0; x < W; x += 6)
  if (d[(y * W + x) * 4 + 3] > 128) pts.push([x, y]);      // targets on a 6 px grid

5–9 rows, dot separators, alternate fill/outline/accent; loop seamlessly by translating modulo one repeat width. Tunings: 5 rows at 200–400 px/s, stroke 2 px (pm-shinskinakamoto-20190b); 6–8 rows blue-on-white / white-on-red, row height ~13 % (pm-shneural-2abdfa); 9 rows at 400–800 px/s with velocity blur (pm-ndhabarde11-f155b4); 6–8 rows at 80–300 px/s varying weight/colour grey/white/accent (pm-levabashidze-2d713a); bold/outline-grey alternation with a band overlay (pm-raphaelaubryy-4b137e); a circular ‘lens’ mask showing the rows recoloured yellow, 100–200 px/s (pm-kangaroohere-b10f8d); filled/outlined tag-pill rows at 40 px/s (pm-techyoutbe-945b56); star separators (pm-topi-003-b0e12c); a continuous red ticker at 60 px/s (pm-henkpoley-3d3407). Idea: three lanes at speed ratio 1 : 0.7 : 0.45 fading over the last 120 px (brief pm-danilowm-d3720d). | code (js): rows.forEach((r, i) => {                       // seamless loop in either direction
  const dir = i % 2 ? 1 : -1;
  const off = (((dir * t * r.speed) % r.repeatW) + r.repeatW) % r.repeatW;
  r.el.style.transform = `translateX(${-off}px)`;   // el holds ≥2 copies of the phrase
});
